# Papers directory — local-only, not tracked in git
# These PDFs are downloaded from arXiv and live in:
#   docs/papers/verified/*.pdf  (5 files, ~28 MB)
#   docs/papers/to_verify/*.pdf (8 files, ~34 MB)
# Total: ~62 MB
#
# Re-run `bash docs/papers/download_papers.sh` to re-download.
#
# The markdown summaries (docs/papers/**/*.md) ARE tracked in git.

*.pdf
!download_papers.sh
!00_HOME.md
